## Calculation

### RULE-invoices.invoice-search-1a2b3c4d: Invoice amount includes tax
**Category:** Calculation
**Priority:** P0
**Source:** `src/INVOICE.cbl:200-212`
**Plain English:** The amount shown on an invoice is the net amount plus tax.
**Specification:**
  Given an invoice with a net amount and a tax rate
  When  the invoice is displayed
  Then  the gross amount is the net amount plus tax
**Confidence:** High

## Policy

### RULE-invoices.invoice-search-5e6f7a8b: Invoice search matches customer, date range and status
**Category:** Policy
**Priority:** P1
**Source:** `src/INVOICE.cbl:340-388`
**Also cited:** Invoices/Search.aspx.cs:22-57
**Plain English:** A search returns invoices that match every filter given.
**Specification:**
  Given a customer, a date range and a status
  When  a person searches
  Then  only invoices matching all three are listed
